From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:29:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure configuration include and ignored-key
 diagnostics

Preserve Info text and config-read success/error paths. Unknown-option logs
contain only the existing key; never add the option value. Preserve the raw
included filename as Name, avoiding an incorrect absolute file.path claim.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py0.51.0, reviewed exact argument catalog):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/config-file-read-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/config-read215-apply.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/common/configfile.cpp src/test/logging_event_tests.cpp
  /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/n4-harness-intake/venv/bin/ruff format test/functional/feature_logging_config_include.py

Manual tests call real ReadConfigStream(ignore_invalid_keys=true), check
unchanged success and key-only typed JSON with a synthetic value canary,
and load a real included config in one isolated wallet-less node. The node
must expose the include's uacomment before its flushed startup JSON is
checked, covering the actual early/buffered config logging path.

Validation at commit: event lint423 sites, Ruff0.15.8 and whitespace pass.
Native/before-after gates pending; first213 immutable proof unchanged.
Tier: shared eCash; V2 inherits. No public header/registry/API changes.
